1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,458
Learn the series as a sentence: halides at the weak end, then hydroxide, water, ammonia, en, nitrite, and cyanide and carbon monoxide at the strong end.

2
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:14,687
Weak field means high spin and pale colours.

3
00:00:14,687 --> 00:00:18,424
Strong field means low spin and deep colours.

